{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model using PCA-encoded RNA data and ResNet50-encoded images with weighted fusion, replacing the previous concatenation fusion strategy. Validation accuracy slightly decreased (0.523 vs. 0.5266) and F1 marginally declined (0.508 vs. 0.510), suggesting weighted fusion may not outperform concatenation in this configuration. The impact of encoder choices and aggregation methods remains uncertain without further comparative analysis."
}

